e":"2026-11-19","zh":"D-Wave Quantum：Gartner 認可，營收成長 21%，利潤率下滑至 52.9% - ad-hoc-news.de"},{"title":"Gartner's $138 Million Share Buyback Meets a Pivotal Turnaround in Contract Value Growth!","src":"Smartkarma","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOSVBFdl8ySlNFa2R3ZEttQVR4eGEtN3MzNEZhRzRmeE45MXBxOU9hYzA0cjFzd3RtbC1lODF4NFp4YmpWMVpoaU9VOENuaE0zTE95Ylo5ODRCaGhaN3pMRllyaXdTQ05mZnlaVUQxeGFVbWlxSHZDclBPNVdNcGthemxlc0phbmFxUUM0S1pJSmZTcHFtV1QxZzRFQm4xTXNROUQzWVUyX1hfRE5yUkhDbExFak9rcUJOZVFFRS1nQVQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-18","zh":""},{"title":"Gartner (IT) Q3 2026 Earnings Report - Results, Call & Slides","src":"TipRanks","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE95TGN4emNYZ0tSYzJJX2g4U0lmN2ZQMWdBY1FCOFlnSzdPdC1TN2JvaWM3RlFwN3Q3T2xja3JzV1p2SHFaMm1BTjdxOEFsbUh4ZUpNUTRyLUk0U25NV1FYbUhvVTdLMEdER2c?oc=5","date":"2026-11-18","zh":"Gartner (IT) 2026 年第三季財報 - 結果、電話會議和投影片"},{"title":"Manhattan Associates Named A Leader In Gartner® Magic Quadrant For Distributed Order Management","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-17","zh":""},{"title":"Gartner (IT) Posts Q3 Earnings And Lifts 2026 Guidance, Is The Stock Still Cheap?","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxObW9lR05ESGZDQmVSWVFiMU9ETHBPa3lJS1p3ZjUyandzWXd1VHFWWWhiVjhRenRXOEg0TjNweGFhZzQ1ZlE2Rk5EVjc0M2VCWHoxeDR6S2ZMYmNER0xRdnBDVXRSMHhxZzV3LXJGME9GeDBqZTJpWEdVN1VhMjhRTGU2OVdDVHozVEJNd0lUS1JJdlFoQy1ZUjhIT2w?oc=5","date":"2026-11-17","zh":"Gartner (IT) 發布第三季獲利並調高 2026 年指引，該股還便宜嗎？"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/749251/000074925126000112/it-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Gartner, Inc. (NYSE: IT) delivers actionable, objective business and technology insights that drive smarter decisions and stronger performance on an organization's mission-critical priorities.","zh":"Gartner, Inc.（NYSE：IT）提供可操作、客觀的業務和技術見解，推動組織在關鍵任務優先事項上做出更明智的決策並提高績效。"},{"en":"We are a trusted advisor and an objective resource for over 13,000 enterprises in approximately 90 countries and territories— across every major function, geography, industry and sector.","zh":""},{"en":"Gartner delivers its products and services globally through three reportable segments – Business and Technology Insights, Conferences and Consulting, as described below. In the second quarter of 2025, we renamed our segment previously referred to as Research to Business and Technology Insights (or \"Insights\") to reflect the nature of the value we provide to clients. In the third quarter of 2025, we changed the structure of our internal organization and concluded that Gartner Digital Markets (\"Digital Markets\") was an operating segment but does not meet the criteria of a reportable segment. Accordingly, Digital Markets results are now included in \"Other\" where segment information is provided. Digital Markets was previously included in our Insights segment. Prior periods have been recast to conform to current period presentation. On February 5, 2026, we completed the sale of Digital Market","zh":"Gartner 通过三个可报告的部门在全球范围内提供其产品和服务：业务和技术洞察、会议和咨询，如下所述。 2025 年第二季度，我們將先前稱為「研究」的部門重新命名為「業務和技術洞察」（或「洞察」），以反映我們為客戶提供的價值的性質。 2025 年第三季度，我們改變了內部組織結構，並得出結論：Gartner 數位市場（「數位市場」）是營運部門，但不符合可報告部門的標準。因此，数字市场结果现在包含在提供分部資訊的“其他”中。数字市场之前包含在我们的洞察部分中。先前期间已重新调整，以符合当前期间的列报。 2026年2月5日，我们完成了Digital Market的出售"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our diversified business model provides multiple entry points and sources of value for our clients that lead to increased client spending on our insights, conferences and consulting services. A critical part of our long-term strategy is to increase business volume and penetration with our most valuable clients, identifying relationships with the greatest sales potential and expanding those relationships by offering strategically relevant insights. We also seek to extend the Gartner brand name to develop new client relationships, augment our sales capacity and expand into new markets around the world. These initiatives have created additional revenue streams through more effective packaging, campaigning and cross-selling of our products and services. In addition, we seek to increase our revenue and operating cash flow through more effective pricing of our products and services.","zh":"我們的多元化業務模式為客戶提供了多種切入點和價值來源，從而增加了客戶在我們的見解、會議和諮詢服務上的支出。我們長期策略的關鍵部分是增加我們最有價值客戶的業務量和滲透率，確定具有最大銷售潛力的關係，並透過提供策略相關的見解來擴大這些關係。我们还寻求扩展 Gartner 品牌名称，以发展新的客户关系、增强我们的销售能力并扩展到全球新市场。这些举措通过更有效的包装、营销和交叉销售我们的产品和服务创造了额外的收入来源。此外，我们寻求通过更有效的产品和服务定价来增加收入和运营现金流。"},{"en":"INSIGHTS. Gartner delivers independent, objective insights to leaders across an enterprise through subscription services that include on-demand access to published content, data and benchmarks, and direct access to a network of more than 2,400 business and technology experts located around the globe. Gartner insights are the fundamental building block for all Gartner products and services. We combine our proprietary research methodologies with extensive industry and academic relationships to create Gartner products and services that address each role across an enterprise. Within the Insights segment, Global Technology Sales (\"GTS\") sells products and services to users and providers of technology, while Global Business Sales (\"GBS\") sells products and services to all other functional leaders, such as human resources, supply chain, finance, and marketing.","zh":"INSIGHTS. Gartner 透過訂閱服務向整個企業的領導者提供獨立、客觀的見解，其中包括按需存取已發布的內容、數據和基準，以及直接存取由全球 2,400 多名業務和技術專家組成的網路。 Gartner 见解是所有 Gartner 产品和服务的基本构建块。 We combine our proprietary research methodologies with extensive industry and academic relationships to create Gartner products and services that address each role across an enterprise.在洞察部門中，全球技術銷售（「GTS」）向技術使用者和提供者銷售產品和服務，而全球業務銷售（「GBS」）則向所有其他職能領導者（例如人力資源、供應鏈、財務和行銷）銷售產品和服務。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Superior content - We believe that we create the broadest, highest-quality and most relevant insights coverage across all major functional roles in an enterprise. Our independent operating model and research analysis generates unbiased insights that we believe are timely, thought-provoking, comprehensive and actionable, and that is known for its high quality, independence and objectivity.","zh":""},{"en":"Our global footprint and established customer base - We have a global presence with clients in approximately 90 countries and territories on six continents. A substantial portion of our revenue is derived from sales outside of the United States.","zh":"Our global footprint and established customer base - We have a global presence with clients in approximately 90 countries and territories on six continents.我們收入的很大一部分來自美國以外的銷售。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Insights","val":5072570000,"zh":"見解"},{"name":"Conferences","val":644743000,"zh":"會議"},{"name":"Consulting","val":552499000,"zh":"諮詢"},{"name":"Other Reportable","val":227414000,"zh":"Other Reportable"}],"total":6497226000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Insights","val":5072570000,"zh":"見解"},{"name":"Conferences","val":644743000,"zh":"會議"},{"name":"Consulting","val":552499000,"zh":"諮詢"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":227414000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":6497226000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"United States & Canada","val":4032601000,"zh":"美國和加拿大"},{"name":"Europe Middle East Africa","val":1693732000,"zh":"Europe Middle East Africa"},{"name":"Other International","val":770893000,"zh":"其他國際"}],"total":6497226000}},"peers":["CDW","JKHY","MTD","VRSK","FTV"]}}